      "content": "it’s just not that simple though. i see the way my husband looks when he thinks i’m not watching—that tired, defeated look. like he's just counting down the hours until he can finally rest. it feels selfish to keep dragging this out. if i could just... stop being a constant drain on their resources and their energy, wouldn't that actually be a kind thing to do?",
